   "triage" : {
      "disposition" : "needs-core-api",
      "reason" : "Devel::Confess 0.009004 installs and passes its suite, but its __DIE__ handler rethrows a native diagnostic as rendered text, changing ERROR_NUMERIC_DOMAIN_DIVISION_BY_ZERO to ERROR_USER_TEXT. Passing the canonical XPerl::Exception to its existing _convert helper segfaults because the helper reblesses the exception. A port needs stable structured stack-trace support without reblessing or textual rethrow.",
